smbftp libdsm patch 2 of 2 - fixes found while testing smbftp 0.5 / 0.6
=======================================================================
Applies to : the tree after patch 1 (apply in order)
Apply with : tools/applydiff.c, -p1, run inside the libdsm source tree

Heap overflow in the Windows smb_from_utf16 (one NUL past the buffer),
validated TRANS2 replies, listings never silently cut short, open-file list
fix, 60 s I/O timeout, bounds-checked share list, smb_session_get_find_flags()
and other smaller fixes.

See README.md, "What the libdsm patches change".

